# BRIDGE rules

Follow `SPECIFICATION.md`. Do not invent catalog facts.

- Every `data/*.json` item needs `source_url` (https) and `checked_at`.
- Missing fact → `null` + UI key `no_data`, never a guess.
- Prices stored as integer CNY; display CNY + USD via `/api/fx`.
- Brand: "BRIDGE · To China". Colors: `#013220` `#0B6E4F` `#50C878` `#D1F2EB`.
- Logo is monochrome (dark on light, white on dark).
- Escape all dynamic HTML. Do not add `'unsafe-inline'` to `script-src`.
- Do not accept applications, payments for admission, or passport scans.
- OTP is 6 digits. CORS allowlist only our origins + localhost.
- Path limit: 10 universities. Storage key `bridge-path-v1`.
- Keep `validate-data.mjs` green.
